 "text": "Stevens County Kansas\nSkip to main content\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nTranslate\nTranslate\nReset Translation\nStevens County Kansas\nLive work play\nMain Menu\nHome\nGovernment\nGovernment\nCounty Commissions\nAgendas\nMinutes prior to 2026\n2026 Minutes\nBoards & Committees\nElections\nLevies\nResolutions\nWork for the County\nDepartments\nDepartments\nAirport\nAppraiser\nAttorney & Counselor\nBuilding Maintenance / Courthouse Janitorial\nClerk of the District Court\nCommunity Health Department\nCounty Clerk\nElections\nMemorial Hall\nRevenue Neutral Rate\nEmergency Services\nGIS\nPlanning & Zoning\nPublic Works\nLandfill & Noxious Weed\nRoad & Bridge\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nTax Search\nWellness Center\nCommunity\nCommunity\nResources for Children, Disabled and Mental Health\nHugoton Chamber of Commerce\nROZ - Rural Opportunity Zone\nSenior Citizens\nStevens County Hospital\nStevens County Library\nStorm Shelters\nTax Search\nWild West Extension District #1\nHow Do I\nHow Do I\nForms & Policies\nApply for\nApply for\nJobs\nContact Us\nReserve Memorial Hall\nSearch\nstart animation\nslide 1 of 1\nTreasurer\nHome\nDepartments\nTreasurer\nRelated Pages\nTax Search\nContact Info\nstop animation\nslide 1 of 4\nTreasurer\nJayme Rich\nemail\njrich@stevenscoks.org\ncall\n(620) 544-2542\nfax\n(620) 544-4094\nDeputy Treasurer\nMisty Peitz\nemail\nmpeitz@stevenscoks.org\nClerk\nEriel Lewis\nemail\nelewis@stevenscoks.org\nClerk\nCiara Greenwood\nemail\ncgreenwood@stevenscoks.org\nResources\nDrivers License\nVehicle Estimator\nMotor Vehicle\nWebTags\nProperty Tax\nFish & Game Licenses\nPayment under Protest Form\nOffice Hours:\nBusiness Hours: 9:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m.\nMotor Vehicle: 9:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. [Title work until 4:15 p.m. and Renewals until 4:30 p.m.]\nDrivers License: Tuesday – Friday 9:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m. by appointment. Please call (620) 544-2542 for an appointment.\nProperty Taxes: To view or pay property taxes online go to www.stevenscoks.us . You can also call our automated payment system at (620) 604-6399 with a bilingual option.\nTo search property taxes and view detailed tax information on properties, visit our Property Tax Search page.\nMission Statement\nThe Stevens County Treasurer’s Office is committed to serving the public with professionalism, accuracy, and efficiency. We strive to provide friendly customer service while responsibly managing county funds, maintaining accurate financial records, and ensuring taxpayer dollars are handled with integrity, security, and accountability.\nDepartment Responsibilities\nThe Treasurer’s Office serves as both a local county office and an agent for the State of Kansas. Our responsibilities include:\nCollecting property taxes for real estate, personal property, businesses, and other taxable entities\nDistributing tax revenues to local taxing entities including schools, cities, and other districts\nManaging county funds and investments with a focus on safety, liquidity, and responsible returns\nProcessing motor vehicle titles, registrations, renewals, and related transactions\nDriver’s license renewals and driver's ed permits\nSelling Kansas hunting and fishing licenses\nOur goal is to provide dependable public service while helping residents efficiently access the services they need.\nOther links:\nSale Fish and Game Licenses , Kansas Boat Renewal , Kansas State Parks Passport and Kansas Resident Lifetime Licenses\nStevens County Kansas\nWelcome To Stevens County, Kansas\nLocations & Maps\nTax Search\nPublic Parcel Search\nCommunity Events\nDepartments\nStevens County,\n200 E 6th Hugoton, Ks 67951\nSearch Stevens County Kansas\nSearch...\nLoading...\nSearch\nTry searching...\nSearch site for\nSearch documents for\nPopular pages\nHome\nEvents\nAccessibility features\nEvent Details\nCity Council Meeting\nView Calendar\nDescription\nRead More\nShare this page\nOn your favorite social media platform\nFacebook\nx(twitter)\nLinkedin\nreddit\nOr\nEmail Page 